{% set name = entry.name %}
Loupe's flash message. {{ entry.summary }}

```jsx
<{{ name }} severity="success">Document saved</{{ name }}>
<{{ name }} severity="error" dismissLabel="Dismiss">Upload failed</{{ name }}>
```

Pass `severity` as `success`, `error`, `warning` or `info`. Pass `dismissLabel` to draw a dismiss button. Pass `title` and `actions` for a notice that needs a heading and buttons: the dot then stays on the first line. Messages are sentence case and never end in a full stop. The component emits the real `{{ entry.rootClass }}` classes of the app.
